								"html": "<div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:300px;background-image:url('https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e94f0f47-ae74-4090-8a13-6b07cc2c4105_Blue+BG.png');background-position:center center;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-size:cover;\" class=\"text-white rounded p-6 gap-3 my-5\">\n            <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;\"></div>\n            <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;min-height:300px;\">\n                <div style=\"width:100%;padding:40px;color:#FFFFFF;\">\n                    <div class=\"btgrid\">\n\t<div class=\"row row-1\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">We are Funded by<br>\n\t\t\t\tOur Thrift Store</h5>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\tEvery year, millions of Americans attempt to declutter their lives, creating vast piles of gently used or sometimes never used treasures.  By Donating those treasures to The Salvation Army, you are helping those in our Adult Rehabilitation Center recover. \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\tA little donation can make a big difference, and we are making it easy! \n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>Drop off locations:</strong></span><br>\n\t\t\t\t\t200 Jefferson Hwy<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Jefferson Hwy\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>Schedule a Pick–Up</strong></span><br>\n\t\t\t\t\tTo schedule a free pick up of your donation call <a href=\"tel:1-800-728-7825\" target=\"\">1-800-SA-TRUCK</a> OR <a href=\"tel:1-800-728-7825\" target=\"\">1-800-728-7825</a> or visit SATRUCK.org\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"/new-orleans/family-thrift-stores\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Visit our Family Thrift Store page</a></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#fff;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ae682411-4466-4ed8-8b0e-93f8197c3d0c_QL9A5382.jpeg\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;width:297.987px;height:359.465px;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\">\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>",
